    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m not sure how your ran it, but pasting (only) the code parts worked for me. YOu might need to hit enter after pasting the top block.<div><div><br></div><div>Specifically I first pasted the top block (then hit enter):</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;word-wrap:break-word;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:14px;line-height:18px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,139,34)\">## function that uses the CLT to generate standard normals from uniform</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,139,34)\">## n is the number of standard normal random numbers to generate</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,139,34)\">## m is the number of uniforms to generate for using the CLT</span>\r\n \r\nCLT_normal <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&lt;-</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span>n, m<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">{</span>\r\n  z <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-weight:bold\">rep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">0</span>,n<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-weight:bold\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span>i <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-weight:bold\">in</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">:</span>n<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">{</span>\r\n    u <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-weight:bold\">runif</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span>m,<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span>\r\n    s <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-weight:bold\">sum</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span>u<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span>\r\n    z<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">[</span>i<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">]</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span>s<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">-</span>m<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">/</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span>m<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">12</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">}</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-weight:bold\">return</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">(</span>z<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">)</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">}</span></pre><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;word-wrap:break-word;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:14px;line-height:18px\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal;white-space:normal\">Then, I pasted the bottom block:</div><div><br></div></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
